# Build intermediates (regenerated by code/reproduce_all.py)
supplementary/*.html
manuscript/*.jpg
manuscript/*.bak
*.log

# NOTE: figures/, tables/ and data/ ARE version-controlled on purpose.
# They are small, they are the artefacts the manuscript cites, and keeping
# them under version control lets a reader diff results across releases
# without running the pipeline. Regenerate with: python code/reproduce_all.py
